{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "288717845b0ef67ed885c764f6be3a6fb30a2a5ff0f20f2f02b30687b3903a58", "ja": "定期公演会の前日リハーサルに遅刻して\nしまった翼。激怒するジュリアに、\n翼と向き合ってほしいと訴える瑞希。\n冷静になったジュリアは翼を理解しようと\n努め、とりあえず外に連れ出すことに。", "zh": "翼在定期公演前一天的彩排中迟到了。\n面对勃然大怒的茱莉亚，\n瑞希请求她能好好面对翼。\n冷静下来的茱莉亚努力试着去理解翼，\n决定先带她到外面去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "cf425ee121ed106a3ff7fc0b8b885c267085f606912e941d48d5abc6963fc443", "ja": "―定期公演会　前日リハーサル―", "zh": "―定期公演　前日彩排―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "098c4c4b1940e23f2ac46a1328b4a660fe8da15c5dd5be16304f784067664071", "ja": "あぁ！？　遅刻ってどういうことだよ！", "zh": "啊！？迟到到底是怎么回事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "0791a0c4690e981d3038bd5142f715cb24e38d6645dfd2c807f54bc09b01e7d6", "ja": "ジュリアさん、代わります。\n準備しててください。", "zh": "茱莉亚先生，我来替您。请准备好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "38b9cdcba8489be4a4901d8557761107647b942d8a1316ea51adbd4d032d34bf", "ja": "どうしたのかな？　怒ってる？", "zh": "怎么了？生气了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "66784e59b8f29ccf2301ef439c37f5b40969cd83ad8cd60194995c9bd68a3661", "ja": "たぶん翼ね……。", "zh": "大概是翼吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "f8ca83b3c7af3a0632358a18db473c0aeab450a776df811ed74785b71743a35d", "ja": "ミズキ、もういい。二人だけでやろう。", "zh": "瑞希，已经够了。我们两个来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "b24cadf6830cc6482f3555e1b37941e9acc7c51e18010b41c7dea72819f8edf4", "ja": "（結局、伊吹さんは間に合わず。\nリハーサルは私とジュリアさんだけで行ったのでした）", "zh": "（结果，伊吹小姐还是没能赶上。\n彩排就只由我和茱莉亚先生两个人完成了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f662010039a7dfae6c8d3a5427e49fbfd418980186932300601dd29584fe378c", "ja": "あのぅ……おはようございま～す。\n遅れてごめんなさ～い。", "zh": "那个……大家早～安。\n迟到了真是对不起～啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "f128ee861bdd15ebf0fd54376e1421df1e04d487e29fd82c631f0197ffdd303b", "ja": "翼……。ちょっと話がある。\n顔貸しな。", "zh": "翼……我有话跟你说。过来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8025bf3005964a71c65a2d27c532d22edcf24db4d9664a7e8a44f11d0da833f0", "ja": "……話？　えっと、ジュリアーノごめんなさい。\n昨日、夜更かししたら起きれなくて……。", "zh": "……说什么？呃，茱莉亚——对不起。昨天熬夜了，结果没能起床……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "7746e1ebaced0f029203cec16b4e49b5aea73f72d35bbb52c305081f320210ca", "ja": "まずは……リハ済ませて来い。\nスタッフにも謝れよ。あたしは、ここで待ってる。", "zh": "先去把彩排做完再回来。也跟工作人员道个歉。我就在这里等你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "8c40b4566e05d9085fb77699b3b6a54fb4d76b6fc4a388e2504b691038d58ccd", "ja": "あの……ジュリアさん。\n伊吹さんと話し合いなら、私も同席しますが？", "zh": "那个……茱莉亚先生。\n如果要和伊吹小姐谈谈的话，我也一起参加，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "a385cd47ad82563b3d3bcd5fb0d9ee4d1d9167f8157b1dfb45a2a48664d53e3e", "ja": "いや。翼のやつ、ミズキがいると甘えるからな。\nこのあたりで、厳しく言っとかねーと。", "zh": "不了。翼那家伙，有瑞希在的话就会撒娇。\n得在这方面好好严厉地说她几句才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "36f030afc8127ca82d1bb75fa69762b33fe4498f3a6da936d87f1fb57b44e68b", "ja": "……。あたしだって、分からないわけじゃないんだ。\n一人でこだわって、アイドルらしくないよなって。", "zh": "……我也不是不明白。\n自己一个人这么执拗，根本不像个偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "67ef4685b234855b0cca0312136e7986f0ebe2d53832a805d3b3258e27424cc0", "ja": "でもさ……アイドルらしくなんて出来ないからこそ、\nせめて歌には真剣でいたいんだ。", "zh": "可是啊……正因为做不到像个偶像，\n所以至少，我想认真对待歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "cde02cccbe620c803aaa292cb726c4c9636f420f10e8a0b4951538703693c7c0", "ja": "……先日。星井さん方のバックダンサーを決める\nオーディションがありまして。", "zh": "……前几天。举办了一场选拔\n星井小姐她们伴舞的试镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "664506bf1e04428eaed984291b7cd8aacf222790a86a9b879cadfb4c746cad05", "ja": "伊吹さんのダンスは、それは見事で。\nだけど真剣な表情でした。", "zh": "伊吹小姐的舞蹈实在精彩，只是表情很认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "337411f7641363b2cfe721206c9344843a465f8f8e1d0486cca87a2d74afb5c8", "ja": "ジュリアさん。どうか……もう一度素直な気持ちで、\n伊吹さんと向き合ってみてはどうでしょうか。", "zh": "茱莉亚先生。请您……再一次以坦率的心情，试着面对伊吹小姐，您看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "7af94ccde7859fd7e31a7a1613c2494ad416b23f51cd9409249c92ec09cd0f94", "ja": "（つまり……、\n今のあたしは翼と向き合ってないってことか？）", "zh": "（也就是说……现在的我，根本没有面对翼，是这个意思吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "74e373868450cee7246e9d28701fe00c2cac429fad13b787ad3b022e36d957b9", "ja": "（今回のコーラスに翼とミズキを指定したのも\nプロデューサーだ。あたしが翼を選んだわけじゃない）", "zh": "（这次合唱指定翼和瑞希，也是制作人的决定。并不是我选了翼。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "b25a8f4a9185f9d5a7723308006d9659ba6cfe597232f022c352dd66b3b4402a", "ja": "（あたしに合わせろって、そればかりで、\nちょっと……失礼だったかもしれないな）", "zh": "（只是一个劲地说要配合我，\n可能……有点失礼了吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "4e748bb059538843b8a2c2d72a110dd9f960c4d612c8b12c011d60717cc6355d", "ja": "素直に……か。", "zh": "坦率地……吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a46d76b9df2af5532542d08e876926e030f2a8cdd2f90f54df75fcdc594e47d", "ja": "あの、ジュリアーノ？　ごめんなさい……怒ってる？\nえっと……スタッフさんには謝ったよ？", "zh": "那个，茱莉亚诺？对不起……你生气了吗？\n那个……我已经向工作人员道过歉了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "915867fff11a107457129bc21d64f9100863c9bf3a67cca981e0432eeae5ef7b", "ja": "謝ったならもういい。次は気をつけろよ？", "zh": "既然道过歉了，那就没事了。下次注意点啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0974c09e582b374a1a3a85300fadb93e314b0fe0652ff669e909242162799e86", "ja": "！　は～い！　次から気をつけま～っす♪", "zh": "！好——的！我下次会注意的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_03_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "6a7ec705432791f0335758ece6d8917dbe78f9f12b0091fc93276a84e1ddec38", "ja": "あ、待て！　翼！\nあー……とりあえず、外出るか？", "zh": "啊，等等！翼！\n呃……总之，先出去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
